00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.480
This would really mean a lot to me

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.070
if you just subscribed to my channel,

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.400
I have many more content
pieces lined up for

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.920
in the next days or weeks.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.990
So I would love to keep
